<h3>Your Manchester Makerspace membership is paid. Come get your key fob</h3>
<p>Hi <%= first_name %>,</p>
<p>Thank you for joining Manchester Makerspace. We received your payment on <%= paid_date %>.</p>
<p>Your membership time starts on the day you receive your key fob, and any payments you have made before then are applied to it, so you have not lost any time while you wait. The next step is to come to an open house, finish your orientation, and pick up your fob.</p>
<p><strong>Open house is every Monday from 6 to 8pm.</strong> Bring a photo ID that matches the name and address on your account. You can see the schedule and any changes here: <a href="https://manchestermakerspace.org/calendar">https://manchestermakerspace.org/calendar</a></p>
<p>If you cannot make a Monday, ask in <strong>#discuss-talk-to-the-board</strong> on Slack and someone will help you find a time.</p>
<p>You can check your account any time at <a href="<%= portal_url %>"><%= portal_url %></a>.</p>
<p>See you soon,<br>Manchester Makerspace</p>
